=2 Walkthrough
* Trade {n:Mhebi Juhbily} (I-10) a {i:Sandfish|Sandfish|4291}. When asked, tell her you give it to her. Then check the shed behind her for a cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Vah Keshura} (H-9).
* Obtain a {i:Tonberry Board|Tonberry Board|1145}.
** {i:Tonberry Board|Tonberry Board|1145}'s drop off {m:Tonberry Pursuers|Tonberry Pursuer} in the {z:Temple of Uggalepih}, {m:Tonberry Shadowers|Tonberry Shadower} in {z:Yhoator Jungle}, and from {m:Tonberry Trailer} in {z:Den of Rancor}.
* Use a {p:Unity Concord} NPC warp to {z:Temple of Uggalepih} (lv125), or follow the directions below.
** Head to (J-12) {z:Yhoator Jungle} to enter the {z:Temple of Uggalepih}.
** Once inside, follow the path and go South at (J-7), then North at (H-9), then North once more at (G-7). This will lead you back outside to the {z:Yhoator Jungle}.
** Head left and re-enter the Temple at (H-11).
*** Be careful not to fall off the ledge here.
* Back inside, head west, then south until you reach (H-10).
* Turn west once more and pass the Granite Door to reach the Tonberry Kitchen.
* Speak to {n:Chef Nonberry}, then trade him the {i:Tonberry Board|Tonberry Board|1145}.
* He will give you the ({p:Key Item}) {k:Nonberry's knife}.
* Return to {n:Mhebi Juhbily} for your reward.

